Pages are shown from the compositor's own output: with remote Core Animation off, the browser (the engine's app) shows each root buffer itself, a frame or more after it is drawn. Five buffers instead of three let it fall three frames behind before a buffer it shows is drawn into again; pending swaps stay at two.

